## Task

Decide what action to take on this stock. Output ONLY a JSON object:

{
  "action": "buy" | "sell" | "hold" | "watch",
  "suggested_weight": 0.0 to {{ "%.2f" | format(max_position_pct) }},
  "reason": "one sentence explaining your decision",
  "urgency": "high" | "medium" | "low"
}

Rules:
- "buy": enter or increase position (suggested_weight > 0)
- "sell": exit or reduce position (suggested_weight = 0)
- "hold": maintain current position
- "watch": no position now, but monitor for entry
- suggested_weight = 0 means close position entirely
